ptions": ["5、9、14", "6、8、15", "7、7、14"], "answer": "6、8、15", "explanation": "5+9=14，14-5=9，可以组成；7+7=14，可以组成；6+8=14不是15，15-6=9不是8，15-8=7不是6，所以6、8、15组不成。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "数列78、80、82、□，□是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "84", "explanation": "每次多数2：78、80、82，下一个是82+2=84。", "verify": "82+2"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "从100开始，每次少10，第4个数是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "70", "explanation": "100是第1个，90是第2个，80是第3个，70是第4个。注意第4个数只走了3步，不要多减一次。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "用数字卡片2、5组成最大的两位数是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "52", "explanation": "把大的数字放在十位：十位是5，个位是2，就是52。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "一个两位数，十位是6，个位比十位小2，这个数比60大还是小？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["比60大", "比60小", "和60一样大"], "answer": "比60大", "explanation": "个位是6-2=4，这个数是64，64比60大。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l3_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l3", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "60添上几个十是100？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "4", "explanation": "100比60多40，40就是4个十，所以添上4个十。", "verify": "(100-60)/10"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l3_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l3", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "一个数是4个十，另一个数比它少5，这两个数加起来是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "75", "explanation": "第一个数是40，另一个数是40-5=35，加起来是40+35=75。", "verify": "40+(40-5)"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l4_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l4", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "48和52中间的数是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "50", "explanation": "48和52中间的数是50：48、49、50、51、52，也可以算(48+52)÷2=50。", "verify": "(48+52)/2"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l4_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l4", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "数轴上，点A是48，点B比点A大15，点C比点B小7，点C离50近还是离60近？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["离50近", "离60近", "一样近"], "answer": "离60近", "explanation": "点B是48+15=63，点C是63-7=56。56离50差6，离60差4，所以离60近。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l5_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l5", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "100里面去掉4个十还剩几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "60", "explanation": "4个十就是40，100-40=60。", "verify": "100-40"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l5_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l5", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "一盒有100支铅笔，拿出2捆（每捆10支）和5支，还剩几支？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "75", "explanation": "2捆就是20支：100-20=80，80-5=75，还剩75支。", "verify": "100-20-5"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l6_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l6", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪个数比68大？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["59", "68", "71"], "answer": "71", "explanation": "59比68小，68和68一样大，71比68大。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l6_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l6", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "用1、8、0组成一个最大的两位数和一个最小的两位数，它们的和是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "91", "explanation": "最大的两位数是81（8在十位，1在个位），最小的两位数是10（0不能在十位），81+10=91。", "verify": "81+10"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l7_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l7", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "与60相邻的两个数的差是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "2", "explanation": "与60相邻的两个数是59和61，61-59=2。", "verify": "61-59"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u2_l7_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u2_l7", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小明想的数比60大3，它相邻的两个数加起来是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "126", "explanation": "小明想的数是60+3=63，相邻的两个数是62和64，62+64=126。", "verify": "62+64"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u3_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u3_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小红10时开始看书，看了2小时，结束时分针指着几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "12", "explanation": "整时结束时分针还是指着12：10时开始，看2小时是12时，分针指着12。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u3_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u3_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "现在是11时，2小时后是几时？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["1时", "13时", "12时"], "answer": "1时", "explanation": "11时过1小时是12时，再过1小时就转回1时，所以是1时，不是13时。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u3_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u3_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "电影2时半开始，放了1个半小时，结束是几时？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "4", "explanation": "2时半过半小时是3时，再过1小时是4时，所以结束是4时。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u3_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u3_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "音乐会9时半结束，演了1小时，开始是几时半？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["8时半", "10时半", "8时"], "answer": "8时半", "explanation": "往前推1小时：9时半减半小时是9时，再减半小时是8时半。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小明算35+24时，先算5+4=9，再算30+20=50，最后是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "59", "explanation": "把个位和十位分开算再合起来：50+9=59。", "verify": "50+9"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "一个加数是36，和是91，另一个加数比36大还是小？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["大", "小", "一样大"], "answer": "大", "explanation": "另一个加数是91-36=55，55比36大。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "□+29=51，□是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "22", "explanation": "想加算减：□就是51比29多的部分，51-29=22。", "verify": "51-29"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪道算式的得数最大？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["47+28", "36+39", "58+19"], "answer": "58+19", "explanation": "47+28=75，36+39=75，58+19=77，最大的是58+19。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l3_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l3", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "15+16+17的得数比50大还是小？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["比50大", "比50小", "等于50"], "answer": "比50小", "explanation": "15+16=31，31+17=48，48比50小。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u4_l3_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u4_l3", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "11+12+13+14=？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "50", "explanation": "按顺序加：11+12=23，23+13=36，36+14=50。", "verify": "11+12+13+14"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "小明的丝带比小红的长，小红的丝带比小刚的短，小明的丝带和小刚的比，谁长？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["无法确定", "小明更长", "小刚更长"], "answer": "无法确定", "explanation": "只知道小红的丝带最短，小明和小刚都比小红长，但两人之间没法比，所以无法确定。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "尺子比铅笔长，铅笔比橡皮长，橡皮比回形针长，把四样从短到长排，排在第3个的是什么？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["铅笔", "橡皮", "尺子"], "answer": "铅笔", "explanation": "从短到长是：回形针、橡皮、铅笔、尺子，第3个是铅笔。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "铅笔长9厘米，橡皮长4厘米，铅笔比橡皮长几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "5", "explanation": "求相差多少用减法：9-4=5，铅笔比橡皮长5厘米。", "verify": "9-4"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小明量铅笔时左端对准1厘米，右端对准10厘米，他以为长10厘米，实际长几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "9", "explanation": "左端没有对准0刻度，要用右端减左端：10-1=9，实际长9厘米。", "verify": "10-1"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l3_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l3", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "一条线段长12厘米，剪去5厘米后，又接上4厘米，现在长几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "11", "explanation": "先减后加：12-5=7，7+4=11，现在长11厘米。", "verify": "12-5+4"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u5_l3_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u5_l3", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "五个点（不在同一条直线上），每两个点连一条线段，一共能连几条线段？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "10", "explanation": "第5个点能和前面4个点各连1条，前面4个点已经连了6条，6+4=10条。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小明量走廊：先走了5步，每步约40厘米，又量了2拃，每拃约10厘米，走廊大约长几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "220", "explanation": "5步是5×40=200厘米，2拃是2×10=20厘米，加起来是200+20=220厘米。", "verify": "5*40+2*10"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "同一根绳子，小明用拃量了8拃，小红用拃量了6拃，谁的一拃长？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["小明", "小红", "一样长"], "answer": "小红", "explanation": "同一根绳子，量的次数越少，说明一拃越长；6次比8次少，所以小红的一拃长。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "同一支铅笔，小红量了2拃（每拃10厘米），小明量了4拃，小明一拃大约几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "5", "explanation": "铅笔长2×10=20厘米，小明4拃量完，20÷4=5厘米。", "verify": "20/4"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "小明用步量操场一周是20步，每步约60厘米；小红用步量是24步，她一步大约几厘米？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "50", "explanation": "操场一周是20×60=1200厘米，小红24步量完，1200÷24=50厘米。", "verify": "20*60/24"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l3_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l3", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "从0米处挂第1面彩旗，彩旗按红、黄、蓝循环，每隔2米挂一面，第10面在几米处？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "18", "explanation": "第10面与第1面之间有9个间隔，9×2=18米，颜色不影响距离。", "verify": "(10-1)*2"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u6_l3_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u6_l3", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "一排彩旗按红、黄、蓝、绿循环，第20面是什么颜色？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["红", "黄", "蓝", "绿"], "answer": "绿", "explanation": "4面一循环，20÷4=5组整，第20面是每组的第4面，是绿色。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u7_l1_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u7_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "1、4、9、16，后面一个数是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "25", "explanation": "相邻两数相差3、5、7，下一个差9，16+9=25。", "verify": "16+9"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u7_l1_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u7_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "numeric", "prompt": "2、3、5、8、13，后面一个数是几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": [], "answer": "21", "explanation": "从第3个数起，每个数是前面两个数的和：2+3=5，3+5=8，5+8=13，8+13=21。", "verify": "8+13"}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u7_l2_q8", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u7_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "数墙A底层是4、9，数墙B底层是2、3、4，哪座数墙的顶层大？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["数墙A", "数墙B", "一样大"], "answer": "数墙A", "explanation": "A的顶层是4+9=13；B的中间层是2+3=5、3+4=7，顶层是5+7=12，13比12大，所以数墙A的顶层大。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hjm_g1b_u7_l2_q9", "topicId": "hjm_g1b_u7_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "数墙底层是□、6、□，中间层是13、15，两个□从左到右分别是几和几？", "englishAudio": null, "options": ["7和9", "6和8", "8和9"], "answer": "7和9", "explanation": "左边□+6=13，得7；6+右边□=15，得9；验算顶层13+15=28，符合。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u0_l1_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u0_l1", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "课堂上，老师用英语跟大家打招呼，小朋友应该先做什么？", "englishAudio": "Good job!", "options": ["开口跟着说", "捂住耳朵", "转过身去"], "answer": "开口跟着说", "explanation": "英语课要敢开口，跟着老师说。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u0_l1_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u0_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "老师说“Listen.”（听），小朋友应该怎么做？", "englishAudio": "Listen.", "options": ["认真听老师说话", "大声说话", "离开座位"], "answer": "认真听老师说话", "explanation": "Listen 是“听”的意思，要安静认真听。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u0_l1_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u0_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪种做法最适合英语准备课？", "englishAudio": "Good job!", "options": ["大声跟着读，不怕读错", "怕读错就不开口", "只看不读"], "answer": "大声跟着读，不怕读错", "explanation": "准备课就是练开口的，读错没关系，多说才会越说越好。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l1_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l1", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "“早上”的英语单词是？", "englishAudio": "morning", "options": ["morning", "afternoon", "evening"], "answer": "morning", "explanation": "morning 是早上，afternoon 是下午，evening 是晚上。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l1_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下午见到同学，应该说？", "englishAudio": "Good afternoon!", "options": ["Good afternoon!", "Good morning!", "Good evening!"], "answer": "Good afternoon!", "explanation": "下午用 afternoon，问候语是 Good afternoon。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l1_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪个单词拼写正确，表示“晚上”？", "englishAudio": "evening", "options": ["evening", "evning", "evenig"], "answer": "evening", "explanation": "evening 拼写是 e-v-e-n-i-n-g，少字母或换顺序都不对。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l2_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l2", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "放学跟老师告别，应该说？", "englishAudio": "Goodbye!", "options": ["Goodbye!", "Hello!", "Good morning!"], "answer": "Goodbye!", "explanation": "告别说 Goodbye；Hello 是见面打招呼。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l2_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "早上小明见到老师说 Good morning，老师会怎么回应？", "englishAudio": "Good morning!", "options": ["Good morning!", "Goodbye!", "Good night!"], "answer": "Good morning!", "explanation": "早上问候要回同样的早上问候。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u1_l2_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u1_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪句是正确的告别？", "englishAudio": "Goodbye, Miss Li!", "options": ["Goodbye, Miss Li!", "Hello, Miss Li!", "Good morning, Miss Li!"], "answer": "Goodbye, Miss Li!", "explanation": "告别用 Goodbye，后两句是见面打招呼。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l1_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l1", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "“朋友”的英语单词是？", "englishAudio": "friend", "options": ["friend", "name", "welcome"], "answer": "friend", "explanation": "friend 是朋友，name 是名字，welcome 是欢迎。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l1_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "新朋友来了，小朋友想表示欢迎，应该说？", "englishAudio": "Welcome!", "options": ["Welcome!", "Goodbye!", "Sit down!"], "answer": "Welcome!", "explanation": "Welcome 是欢迎；Goodbye 是告别。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l1_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪个单词表示“名字”？", "englishAudio": "name", "options": ["name", "neme", "mane"], "answer": "name", "explanation": "name 拼写是 n-a-m-e，不要跟 mane 或错拼混淆。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l2_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l2", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "小明想告诉新朋友自己叫 Xiaoming，他应该说？", "englishAudio": "I'm Xiaoming.", "options": ["I'm Xiaoming.", "You're Xiaoming.", "He's Xiaoming."], "answer": "I'm Xiaoming.", "explanation": "介绍自己用 I'm…；You're 是“你是”，He's 是“他是”。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l2_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l2", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "小红想问新朋友叫什么名字，她应该问？", "englishAudio": "What's your name?", "options": ["What's your name?", "How old are you?", "Where are you?"], "answer": "What's your name?", "explanation": "问名字用 What's your name?；How old 问年龄，Where 问地点。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u2_l2_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u2_l2", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "新朋友问你 What's your name?，你叫 Lily，应该回答？", "englishAudio": "I'm Lily.", "options": ["I'm Lily.", "I'm a girl.", "I'm six."], "answer": "I'm Lily.", "explanation": "问名字就答名字；I'm six 答的是年龄，不对题。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u3_l1_q1", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u3_l1", "difficulty": "basic", "type": "choice", "prompt": "“铅笔”的英语单词是？", "englishAudio": "pencil", "options": ["pencil", "ruler", "book"], "answer": "pencil", "explanation": "pencil 是铅笔，ruler 是尺子，book 是书。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u3_l1_q2", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u3_l1", "difficulty": "medium", "type": "choice", "prompt": "装铅笔、橡皮的盒子叫？", "englishAudio": "pencil case", "options": ["pencil case", "schoolbag", "desk"], "answer": "pencil case", "explanation": "pencil case 是铅笔盒；schoolbag 是书包；desk 是课桌。", "verify": ""}, {"id": "hje_g1a_u3_l1_q3", "topicId": "hje_g1a_u3_l1", "difficulty": "hard", "type": "choice", "prompt": "下面哪个单词表示“橡皮”？", "englishAudio": "eras